---
import Icon from './MarketingIcon.astro';
import '../styles/closing-sections.css';
const questions=[['lock','What access does DryDock need?','Access depends on the tools and workflow you connect. We review repository scope, required signals and permissions with your team, using read-only access where the integration supports it. Agree access and data boundaries before connecting.'],['code','How is DryDock different from CI/CD?','CI/CD runs your pipeline. DryDock connects change context, policy checks and human decisions across delivery. It brings the evidence together so you can explain why a release moved forward.'],['users','Does every change need human approval?','Your policy defines which changes need judgment. DryDock routes exceptions to the responsible person with supporting evidence. Review requirements and release gates are agreed with your team.'],['layers','Can we adapt the policies and agents to our workflow?','Bring a policy you use today, such as senior review for payment changes. We will explore the goal, signals, logic, action and human owner with you. The agent builder on this page is an interactive preview, not a deployment tool.'],['shield','How does DryDock handle our data?','Before connecting, review what is accessed, where it is processed, retention, model-provider handling and deployment requirements with our team. We will confirm the supported setup for your environment.'],['bolt','What does early access include, and what does it cost?','We will confirm available capabilities, onboarding scope and commercial terms for your needs before you commit. The walkthrough is a chance to evaluate your use case and agree the next step.'],['clock','What should I bring to the demo?','Bring a release scenario, a policy question or an overview of your stack. We can start with an illustrative release and agree what is appropriate to share. Please do not send source code, credentials or sensitive release details through the enquiry form.']];
const goals=[['chart','AI ROI','Is our AI investment actually improving delivery?'],['shield','Release confidence','Do we have enough evidence to ship this change?'],['clock','Review bottleneck','Where is senior engineering time being consumed?'],['layers','Governance & compliance','Can we prove why this release was approved?']];
---
<section class="closing-faq" id="faq"><div class="closing-wrap closing-faq-grid"><div class="closing-faq-copy"><span class="closing-eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</span><h2>Good questions.<br/><em>Straight answers.</em></h2><p>Common questions from engineering and platform teams to help you evaluate DryDock with confidence.</p><div class="closing-assurances">{[['shield','Security first'],['layers','Works with your stack'],['bolt','Fast to try']].map(([icon,label])=><span><Icon name={icon}/><b>{label}</b></span>)}</div></div><div class="closing-questions">{questions.map(([icon,q,a],i)=><details name="drydock-faq" open={i===0}><summary><Icon name={icon} tone={i===2?'purple':'blue'}/><strong>{q}</strong><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="closing-start" id="early-access"><div class="closing-wrap"><div class="closing-start-grid"><div class="closing-start-copy"><span class="closing-eyebrow">07 / GET STARTED</span><h2>Bring us one real release.<br/><em>We’ll show you what<br/>DryDock sees.</em></h2><p>Pick the question you want DryDock to answer. We’ll explore a release scenario with you and walk through the findings.</p><div class="walk-goals" role="group" aria-label="Choose your walkthrough focus">{goals.map(([icon,title,desc],i)=><button type="button" data-walk-goal={i} aria-pressed={i===0}><Icon name={icon} tone={['purple','green','orange','blue'][i]}/><span><strong>{title}</strong><span>{desc}</span></span><b class="goal-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</b></button>)}</div></div><div class="walk-panel"><span class="closing-eyebrow">▷ YOUR DRYDOCK WALKTHROUGH</span><ol class="walk-steps">{[['code','Connect one release'],['layers','Reconstruct its evidence'],['shield','Apply your policy'],['bolt','Show the decision'],['chart','Connect the production outcome']].map(([icon,title],i)=><li class:list={{featured:i===3}}><Icon name={icon}/><b>0{i+1}</b><span>{title}</span></li>)}</ol><div class="walk-focus" aria-live="polite"><span id="walk-focus-label">YOUR FOCUS / AI ROI</span><strong id="walk-focus-title">Connect AI investment to delivery outcomes.</strong><p id="walk-focus-copy">Explore AI usage, review effort and release stability together, with the context behind the numbers.</p></div><div class="walk-perks">{[['clock','30 minutes'],['layers','Your stack'],['code','Your release'],['users','Your questions']].map(([icon,label])=><span><Icon name={icon}/>{label}</span>)}</div><a class="walk-book" id="walk-book" href="https://calendly.com/suralal-s?utm_source=drydock&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=walkthrough&utm_content=ai-roi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book my walkthrough <span>→</span></a><small class="walk-book-note">Choose a time on Calendly. Selected focus is included in the booking link.</small></div></div><details class="closing-enquiry"><summary>Prefer an introduction first? Request early access <span>＋</span></summary><slot/></details></div></section>
<script>
const root=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.closing-start')!;
const options=[['AI ROI','Connect AI investment to delivery outcomes.','Explore AI usage, review effort and release stability together, with the context behind the numbers.','ai-roi'],['Release confidence','Understand what makes this release ready.','Follow the checks, policy exceptions and human approval needed to make an informed release decision.','release-confidence'],['Review bottleneck','Find where decisions are waiting.','Explore review queues, evidence gaps and routing so senior engineering time goes to the changes that need judgment.','review-bottleneck'],['Governance & compliance','Explain why the release was approved.','Trace the original intent, checks, named approver and recorded decision through to the production outcome.','governance-compliance']];
const buttons=Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-walk-goal]'));
buttons.forEach((button,i)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const [label,title,copy,key]=options[i];buttons.forEach((b,j)=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(i===j)));root.querySelector('#walk-focus-label')!.textContent='YOUR FOCUS / '+label.toUpperCase();root.querySelector('#walk-focus-title')!.textContent=title;root.querySelector('#walk-focus-copy')!.textContent=copy;const link=root.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#walk-book')!;const url=new URL(link.href);url.searchParams.set('utm_content',key);link.href=url.toString();}));
</script>
